    "name": "Effect: Energy Shield Tunic",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>During your daily preparations, you choose one of the following energy types: acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic. You gain resistance 10 to the chosen energy type until your next daily preparations. The tunic changes color and gains thematic embroidery to reflect the energy type you've chosen.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Acid</strong> The tunic turns brown and has acid splashes embroidered in bright green thread.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cold</strong> The tunic turns sky blue and has snowflakes embroidered in silver thread.</p></li><li><p><strong>Electricity</strong> The tunic turns dark gray and has lightning bolts embroidered in light blue thread.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fire</strong> The tunic turns orange and has balls of fire embroidered in red and yellow threads.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sonic</strong> The tunic turns white and has musical notes embroidered in golden thread.</p></li></ul>"
        },
